	)
	(text "Flight-data log: the Tinker-Mantis SPI NAND (U11 there), on the four ESP32-P4 GPIOs this board left free:\nGPIO0 = CS (R701 keeps it deselected through reset and boot), GPIO9 = MISO, GPIO33 = SCK,\nGPIO34 = MOSI (GPIO34 is the P4's JTAG-source strap: a NAND input, no pull on it).\nWP# and HOLD# pulled up as on the Mantis: plain 1-bit SPI."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
